 écoute pour échanger sur votre projet.","addr":"Rue Caroline / Rue du 11 Novembre","gal":["https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6IjA5MzUzMjg0M2YyMDlhM2Y5MDEyOWRiZmFhZDc1MWI0ZjA1YzRkOGMiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiIyMDhiZjAyZTlhODk2NDkwOTFlYTc0MmU2OWNlOGZiYiJ9?signature=27d9f4ddda81795e06b7b0dcbc1e77466d66aa9a275b9d33cbadd754de57ba3e","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6IjI2NzkyYzJiOTI2NmRhY2E2MThkNTc2YjRhZDFkZmI1YTkzOWJhY2EiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiI5NzVkZDk4ZGUwMzU2ODRkOTI4NGIzMGY3ZTQ4Zjc1ZiJ9?signature=6d21c0c4065dccecaefc222ca0636c7cc73e98ded273d82dad2a9fb8b90aa5c8","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6ImJlM2U3NjZlNzM0MzM2YjI5MjJmNGM5MmVlZjZiZWJlMDg4NDI1OTAiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiJhYmFjYTE5OWNkNDY3MTZlMjg2NGVjYmY0MWRkYmVhNCJ9?signature=1ed8d6699d502e55d26e5d629448c0a8b78230de0c75a4d20cbaa48998246f8f","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6ImIzNmM0ZDU3YTA5MDY1ZWVjZTZhMDVlYmIzOTIxN2M2ZmNiZTI4Y2UiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiJjM2VjZjU0YzA4NzlhMGQ2OTkyN2E3ODUxNjE5NTg5OSJ9?signature=022ba1f9be17b38220fe8ef408d844744863c0f0e27bec372cbf7a151b5742b2","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6IjQxOWZiMGYyZDA5MmM1ZDUzNjk5MGRlY2Y4N2MwNzgzNDhlYzRmMzEiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiJiZjYzZjM5MGUyNTA0MGEyMjM0OTU5MzViMGE2YjlhZiJ9?signature=4d1676e63e8088f3ec3eff7c3b91d76fadcdb146c003ca27e61ea06db05faba6","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJv